Package: time-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         linuxptp
Description: PTP telemetry agent
 Per-node agent that collects metrics from ptp4l, phc2sys, ppswatch and
 system files, then publishes them over ZeroMQ to the timesync-analyzer
 service. Ships a systemd unit and default configuration under
 /etc/time-agent/.
